186436902 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436877 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436902 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436878 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436902 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436892 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436902 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436902 1077 "selection" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436902 1078 #edb/ref 17592186436877 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436902 1079 #uuid "b088d621-a153-59a3-b489-cec7c0d60c3e" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436903 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436867 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436903 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436872 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436903 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436883 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436903 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436891 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436903 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436896 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436903 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436903 1077 "selection" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436903 1078 #edb/ref 17592186436872 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436903 1079 #uuid "bcde5f17-b09d-5acb-97f8-219e272aac7c" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436904 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436898 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436904 1069 "q-132874" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436904 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436904 1071 "Find ${g}_{xy}(x,y)+{g}_{xx}(x,y)$ given that  ${g}_{x}(x,y)=\\frac{x}{x-{y}^{2}}.$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436904 1072 #uuid "073f1d9a-253b-5fca-9478-5f95eebb298d" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436904 1074 "To find ${g}_{xy}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${g}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({g}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{x}{x-{y}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2xy}{(x-{y}^{2})^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find ${g}_{xx}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${g}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({g}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{x}{x-{y}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{(x-{y}^{2})-x}{(x-{y}^{2})^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{(x-{y}^{2})^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xy}(x,y)+{g}_{xx}(x,y) & =\\frac{2xy}{(x-{y}^{2})^{2}}+(-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{(x-{y}^{2})^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2xy-{y}^{2}}{(x-{y}^{2})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{y(2x-y)}{(x-{y}^{2})^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436905 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436901 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436905 1069 "q-132766" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436905 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436905 1071 "For the function $f(x,y),$ calculate $\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}}$ given that $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=-\\frac{{y}^{2}+2}{{x}^{3}}.$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436905 1072 #uuid "0e8c2128-4248-5b42-9124-e32c52ba652f" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436905 1074 "To find $\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}}$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{∂f}{∂x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(-\\frac{{y}^{2}+2}{{x}^{3}}) \\\\  & =-({y}^{2}+2)\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{{x}^{4}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3({y}^{2}+2)}{{x}^{4}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436906 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436900 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436906 1069 "q-132929" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436906 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436906 1071 "Calculate ${f}_{xyx}(x,y)$ given that $f(x,y)=y{e}^{2x}+\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}.$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436906 1072 #uuid "ab886db8-155f-5495-98ff-0f64afbbb0bd" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436906 1074 "First, we find the first-order derivative ${f}_{x}(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y{e}^{2x}+\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}) \\\\  & =2y{e}^{2x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we find ${f}_{xy}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({f}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2y{e}^{2x}) \\\\  & =2{e}^{2x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we find ${f}_{xyx}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{xy}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xyx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{xy}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2{e}^{2x}) \\\\  & =4{e}^{2x}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436907 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436902 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436907 1069 "q-132801" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436907 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436907 1071 "For the function $f(x,y),$ calculate $\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}}$ given that $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x-y)}{xy}.$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436907 1072 #uuid "cca3fd6b-4c7e-554a-be83-06e03ae9adfd" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436907 1074 "To find $\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}}$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{∂f}{∂x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x-y)}{xy}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{y}\\cdot (\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x-y)\\cdot x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x-y)\\cdot 1}{{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x-y)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x-y)}{{x}^{2}y}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436908 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436899 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436908 1069 "q-132888" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436908 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436908 1071 "Find ${f}_{xy}(x,y)+{f}_{yx}(x,y)$ given that  ${f}_{x}(x,y)=\\frac{1}{{e}^{x+2y}}$ and ${f}_{y}(x,y)=\\frac{2}{{e}^{x+2y}}.$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436908 1072 #uuid "df95e8a9-100a-5208-bae6-3713a6f72f62" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436908 1074 "To find ${f}_{xy}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${f}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({f}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{1}{{e}^{x+2y}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{{e}^{x+2y}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find ${f}_{yx}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${f}_{y}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{y}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{2}{{e}^{x+2y}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{{e}^{x+2y}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xy}(x,y)+{f}_{yx}(x,y) & =-\\frac{2}{{e}^{x+2y}}-\\frac{2}{{e}^{x+2y}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{{e}^{x+2y}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436909 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436903 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436909 1069 "q-132930" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436909 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436909 1071 "Calculate ${f}_{yxx}(x,y)$ given that $f(x,y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\operatorname{cos}⁡{x}^{2}.$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436909 1072 #uuid "e658e0b8-0325-5757-88c4-d4fe9ead78af" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true] [17592186436909 1074 "First, we find the first-order derivative ${f}_{y}(x,y):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{y}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\operatorname{cos}⁡{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{x}^{2}\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡y) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we find ${f}_{yx}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{y}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{y}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\cdot (-2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =-2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we find ${f}_{yxx}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{yx}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yxx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{yx}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(-2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\cdot (-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{x}^{2}-4{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\,(\\operatorname{sin}⁡{x}^{2}+2{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{x}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534811 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-0b6c9b46-c3c9-5483-8476-52cbdd59ac4c" 17592186436863 "answer-0f05c210-c0a0-5abb-b730-98796dd2186c" 17592186436864 "answer-1121a6b7-cfce-5dfc-b0da-6a636079944b" 17592186436865 "answer-11de066d-e9e2-5d24-a361-76b8dd01b39d" 17592186436866 "answer-18c37a0f-f8cb-5b42-a75e-149ceaf31b64" 17592186436867 "answer-244430db-783b-5513-8f92-180fb3fb6d6c" 17592186436868 "answer-25385035-93dd-5e7e-9e2e-385ef7c008a0" 17592186436869 "answer-28922764-7076-5aaf-bcbd-67e10b791794" 17592186436870 "answer-3288153e-27f3-5222-851e-a6b3e5822126" 17592186436871 "answer-389d3dc9-f2d9-529c-b7ea-c8cccd9b9758" 17592186436872 "answer-45f532dc-3af3-545d-ad50-9441c35b268b" 17592186436873 "answer-53fc4b27-5931-514e-ac5a-d3a502d333bd" 17592186436874 "answer-5c5ccad9-69a4-5358-b839-33102f74fe79" 17592186436875 "answer-6d8c9b27-0381-54e8-bb1c-7c96aeb216a2" 17592186436876 "answer-6e16fead-d7a4-5f11-af57-d52230ead1dd" 17592186436877 "answer-72704398-44ea-5224-9ffc-3f29a7a9b2b8" 17592186436878 "answer-73c25a30-7b77-51c9-b420-ba135dbcd471" 175921864